                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Got this for free on /v/ when the dev was handing out codes. \n\nThe handling is alright outside of the wall slide and air dash at times. The weapons were decent enough but I mainly stuck with the charge shot due to how useful it was the entire game. Presentation wise it does well enough, the art and music have a certain feel to it that remind me of some of the older indie games on steam. \n\nWhile I personally wouldn't recommend it, it's not an awful game. Like most platformers, there isn't really a draw to come back to it once you finish the final boss since you've pretty much seen most of what the game offers.\n\nThanks for the key dev, and I hope you continue working on stuff.\n",
